# Event posters live on the server, not in git.
# Deploy is `cp -R ./* public_html/`, which overwrites by filename but never
# deletes. So a poster tracked here silently replaces the artwork uploaded
# through cPanel on the next deploy — that happened once already. Keeping
# posters out of the repo means deploys leave them alone, and it keeps tens
# of megabytes of artwork out of every clone.
# Upload them in cPanel File Manager to public_html/ as:
#   event-poster.png     Alter Ego
#   insane-poster.png    Insane Rave
*-poster.png
*-poster.jpg
*-poster.webp
